# .understandignore — Boulder analysis scope
# Trimmed to ~250 files: core services, libraries, schema, infra, docs.
# Syntax matches .gitignore (globs, # comments, ! negation, trailing / for dirs).

# --- Dependencies / build artifacts (restated; covered by built-in defaults) ---
vendor/
bin/
.gocache/
.pi/

# --- Tests we don't want analyzed ---
*_test.go
mocks/
test/

# Keep ratelimits/testdata/ — it documents the rate-limit schema
!ratelimits/testdata/
!ratelimits/testdata/**

# --- Generated code (proto sources are kept) ---
*.pb.go

# --- Lint test fixtures (keep lint Go sources) ---
linter/lints/**/*.pem
linter/lints/**/*.json
linter/lints/test/

# --- Static data lists (IANA special-use domains) ---
iana/data/

# --- Build and release tooling ---
tools/

# --- Binary releases ---
*.deb
*.tar.gz

# --- Lockfile / generated checksum data ---
go.sum

# --- Top-level one-off dev scripts (not shipped, not deployed) ---
/t.sh
/tn.sh
/test.sh
/start.py

# --- LICENSE variants, metadata configs, dependabot wiring ---
LICENSE.txt
CODEOWNERS
.dockerignore
.typos.toml
.golangci.yml
.github/FUNDING.yml
.github/dependabot.yml
.github/issue_template.md
